* ro-vth-drift-sensitivity: array deck at Vdd=1.8 V, generated by sim/ro-vth-drift-sensitivity/campaign.py
* source testbench: sim/ro-array-core-combining/testbench/tb_ro_array_core.spice
* design netlist: design/ro_array_core.spice (wrapped)
* --- vth-drift gate-offset wrappers v1 (sim/ro-vth-drift-sensitivity/aging.py) ---
.global vth_dvn vth_dvp
.subckt vth_wrap_nfet d g s b L=1 W=1 nf=1 ad=1 as=1 pd=1 ps=1 nrd=1 nrs=1 sa=1 sb=1 sd=1 mult=1 m=1
Esh g gd vth_dvn 0 1
Xdev d gd s b sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=L W=W nf=nf ad=ad as=as pd=pd ps=ps nrd=nrd nrs=nrs sa=sa sb=sb sd=sd mult=mult m=m
.ends
.subckt vth_wrap_pfet d g s b L=1 W=1 nf=1 ad=1 as=1 pd=1 ps=1 nrd=1 nrs=1 sa=1 sb=1 sd=1 mult=1 m=1
Esh g gd vth_dvp 0 -1
Xdev d gd s b sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=L W=W nf=nf ad=ad as=as pd=pd ps=ps nrd=nrd nrs=nrs sa=sa sb=sb sd=sd mult=mult m=m
.ends
* --- end wrappers ---
